<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px6" title="In 5 Discussion ‣ Where Vision Becomes Text: Locating the OCR Routing Bottleneck in Vision-Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">DeepStack Injection Signature in Qwen Models.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px7" title="In 5 Discussion ‣ Where Vision Becomes Text: Locating the OCR Routing Bottleneck in Vision-Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Implications for Interpretability.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px8" title="In 5 Discussion ‣ Where Vision Becomes Text: Locating the OCR Routing Bottleneck in Vision-Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Future Directions.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
