<section id="A2.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.2 </span>Top OCR-Selective Attention Heads</h3>

<div id="A2.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A2.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ B.2 Top OCR-Selective Attention Heads ‣ Appendix B Complete Results Tables ‣ Where Vision Becomes Text: Locating the OCR Routing Bottleneck in Vision-Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> lists the 20 most OCR-selective attention heads by selectivity ratio.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T8" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A2.T8.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A2.T8.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T8.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Rank</th>
